```java
String s = "oCean";
String r = "";
for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {
    char c = s.charAt(i);
    if (c >= 'a' && c <= 'm') {
        r += c;
    } else {
        r += "*";
    }
}
System.out.println(r);
```

